5. Summary
Central Role of Conductor MCP:

Analyzes each incoming email, determines its intent and risk, and then routes it appropriately.

Email MCP Capabilities:

Uses an LLM to generate intelligent responses, distinguishing between low-risk auto-responses and high-risk draft replies.

Collaborative Process:

High-risk cases involve human oversight via the dashboard, ensuring critical communications are handled with care.

Continuous Improvement:

Detailed logging and feedback loops between the Conductor MCP and Email MCP enable ongoing optimization of email processing.

This integrated approach balances automation with necessary human intervention, ensuring that our platform is both efficient and reliable while paving the way for future expansion into other modules.

